
---

## `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# =========================
# Fichiers R / RStudio
# =========================

.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Ruserdata

# Dossier RStudio
.Rproj.user/

# =========================
# Fichiers temporaires
# =========================

*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp

# =========================
# Logs
# =========================

*.log

# =========================
# Fichiers système
# =========================

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# =========================
# VS Code
# =========================

.vscode/

# =========================
# Cache
# =========================

cache/
tmp/
temp/

# =========================
# Fichiers LaTeX / PDF
# =========================

*.aux
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz

# =========================
# Fichiers RMarkdown
# =========================

*_cache/
*.utf8.md
*.knit.md

# =========================
# Environnements
# =========================

.Renviron
Renviron.site

# =========================
# Bibliothèques locales
# =========================

renv/library/
packrat/lib/

# =========================
# Sauvegardes
# =========================

*~
